  "notes": "Waiver filing, cash basis, Exhibit A by fund (p1/p3 General, Street, Enterprise, Library, Cemetery, Fire; p2/p4 Keno, Rev. Sharing, Amplifund). Enterprise Fund is business-type (its spending printed on line 29 General Government and line 36 Other Capital Outlay); all other funds governmental. Governmental lines = Total column minus the Enterprise column. Transfers per attachment p6: Street, Enterprise, Library, Keno, Rev. Sharing -> General; Fire -> Keno (total 256,350.25). Enterprise -> General 6,114.62 is business-type transfers_net. Capital Improvements / Other Capital Outlay have no printed function (only the Street Fund column's piece in detail is labelled Streets/Highways). Beginning/ending cash are line 3/line 24 subtotals (net cash + investments) minus Enterprise, as in FY2024. County Treasurer balances (751.65 / 938.71) printed below the statement are not included. Roll-forward governmental: 300,209.30 + 755,140.52 - 826,329.34 + 256,350.25 - 250,235.63 = 235,135.10; business: 32,372.54 + 44,624.55 - 54,016.56 - 6,114.62 = 16,865.91. No supplementary schedules; detail is per fund column of Exhibit A. Read pages 1-6 of 6"
